WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.350
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:04.019
SPEAKER: Thank you, veterans.

00:00:04.019 --> 00:00:09.540
Thank you for quiet mornings
and family breakfasts, morning

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:13.220
walks, and safe streets.

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:19.920
For builders, both of
cities, and of homes.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:25.890
For freedoms, choices, beliefs.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.170
Thank you for your oath.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:32.259
Thank you for 2:00 AM night
watches, and 5:00 AM ruck

00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:33.430
marches.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:36.635
For scrubbing,
mopping, and plunging.

00:00:36.635 --> 00:00:40.370
For papers, plans, and routes.

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:46.180
Thank you for following
orders, leading your team,

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:49.280
and carrying your
brothers back home.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:53.870
Thank you, veterans, for
sticking to your oath,

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.770
so that we all can wake up to
another quiet morning tomorrow.

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.639
[MUSIC PLAYING]

